这是什么，一集也就10分钟吗？

614
00:29:35.290 --> 00:29:35.490
No.
不是。

615
00:29:35.670 --> 00:29:40.290
The guy who, the young blonde guy became king.
那个家伙，那个年轻的金发小伙子当了国王。

616
00:29:40.530 --> 00:29:41.090
Joffrey.
乔佛里。

617
00:29:41.450 --> 00:29:41.790
Yeah.
对。

618
00:29:42.010 --> 00:29:46.510
He decapitated the man that I was loving to follow.
他把那个我特别喜欢看的男人给斩首了。

619
00:29:47.550 --> 00:29:48.630
The main guy.
主角。

620
00:29:48.870 --> 00:29:49.010
Sean.
肖恩。

621
00:29:49.190 --> 00:29:49.670
What's his name?
他叫什么名字来着？

622
00:29:49.810 --> 00:29:50.050
Sean.
肖恩。

623
00:29:50.630 --> 00:29:52.170
The daughter saw it.
他女儿看到了。

624
00:29:53.690 --> 00:29:54.930
No, she didn't see it.
不，她没看到。

625
00:29:55.030 --> 00:29:56.210
People wouldn't let her see it.
人们没让她看。

626
00:29:56.790 --> 00:29:57.670
But it's...
但是……

627
00:29:57.670 --> 00:29:59.670
I mean, his head was on a spike for weeks.
我是说，他的头在长矛上挂了好几周。

628
00:29:59.790 --> 00:30:01.330
I think she eventually saw it.
我想她最终还是看到了。

629
00:30:01.450 --> 00:30:01.970
Ned Stark.
奈德·史塔克。

630
00:30:02.430 --> 00:30:02.870
Yeah.
对。

631
00:30:02.970 --> 00:30:03.190
Yes.
是的。

632
00:30:03.290 --> 00:30:03.950
Ned Stark.
奈德·史塔克。

633
00:30:03.950 --> 00:30:04.270
Okay.
好吧。

634
00:30:04.470 --> 00:30:07.410
I was a real big fan of the Stark family.
我曾是史塔克家族的铁杆粉丝。

635
00:30:07.890 --> 00:30:11.310
And when they decapitated the patriarch of that family.
当他们把那个家族的族长斩首时。

636
00:30:11.530 --> 00:30:12.430
That's when you gave up.
那就是你弃剧的时候。

637
00:30:12.570 --> 00:30:13.210
That is early.
那确实很早。

638
00:30:13.210 --> 00:30:13.610
Okay, wait.
等等，好吧。

639
00:30:13.770 --> 00:30:14.450
There was...
当时有……

640
00:30:14.450 --> 00:30:15.950
This is really when they lost me.
这才是他们真正让我失去兴趣的地方。

641
00:30:16.070 --> 00:30:20.030
Was that there was a whole new land that was introduced.
就是引入了一整片全新的大陆。

642
00:30:20.690 --> 00:30:24.950
Remember when the woman started being like red and...
还记得那个女人开始变得浑身通红，然后……

643
00:30:27.430 --> 00:30:28.330
Do you remember?
你还记得吗？

644
00:30:28.630 --> 00:30:28.750
Yes.
记得。

645
00:30:28.790 --> 00:30:33.830
Game of Thrones is constantly introducing new land and new people.
《权力的游戏》一直在引入新的大陆和新的人物。

646
00:30:33.950 --> 00:30:34.290
Yeah.
是啊。

647
00:30:34.470 --> 00:30:35.430
They sailed there.
他们航行到了那里。

648
00:30:35.690 --> 00:30:37.090
And then she...
然后她……

649
00:30:37.090 --> 00:30:38.510
There were visions, I think.
我想当时有一些幻象。

650
00:30:38.750 --> 00:30:38.990
Yes.
是的。

651
00:30:39.110 --> 00:30:39.990
She's kind of a witch.
她有点像个女巫。

652
00:30:40.210 --> 00:30:40.470
Okay.
好吧。

653
00:30:40.790 --> 00:30:41.610
I was out.
我当时没看。

654
00:30:41.970 --> 00:30:42.330
Okay.
好吧。

655
00:30:42.330 --> 00:30:43.130
How far did I get?
我看到哪儿了？

656
00:30:43.290 --> 00:30:44.030
How far is that?
那是哪儿？

657
00:30:44.250 --> 00:30:45.190
Is that season two?
那是第二季吗？

658
00:30:46.070 --> 00:30:48.130
That's two out of ten, maybe.
大概十集里看了两集吧。

659
00:30:49.310 --> 00:30:51.530
You've seen an eighth of the show.
你才看了八分之一。

660
00:30:51.950 --> 00:30:53.330
Did I make it to season two?
我看到第二季了吗？

661
00:30:53.910 --> 00:30:54.310
Yes.
看到了。

662
00:30:54.590 --> 00:30:54.990
I did?
真的吗？

663
00:30:55.190 --> 00:30:55.850
I think so.
我想是吧。

664
00:30:55.890 --> 00:30:56.530
Well, there you go.
你看，这不就成了嘛。

665
00:30:56.530 --> 00:30:57.010
I'm going to let you know.
我会让你知道的。

666
00:30:57.190 --> 00:30:58.130
That's not so bad.
那还不算太糟。

667
00:30:58.670 --> 00:30:59.630
Wait, let me tell you.
等等，让我告诉你。

668
00:30:59.630 --> 00:31:02.890
But I'll tell you, in those episodes, I don't remember anybody flying on a dragon.
但我得说，在那些集数里，我不记得有人骑龙。

669
00:31:03.450 --> 00:31:03.850
Melisandre.
梅丽珊卓。

670
00:31:03.950 --> 00:31:05.330
You made it, too.
你也看到了。

671
00:31:06.390 --> 00:31:07.390
Oh, my God.
天哪。

672
00:31:07.650 --> 00:31:09.030
How do I find that out, Sam?
山姆，我该怎么查到这个？

673
00:31:09.490 --> 00:31:12.230
Jenna, if it makes you feel better, I've never seen Game of Thrones.
珍娜，如果能让你好受点的话，我从来没看过《权力的游戏》。

674
00:31:12.410 --> 00:31:14.250
It does make me feel better, Cassie.
这确实让我好受多了，凯西。

675
00:31:14.250 --> 00:31:14.630
Cassie?
凯西？

676
00:31:14.770 --> 00:31:15.130
Cassie, it does.
凯西，确实如此。

677
00:31:15.570 --> 00:31:16.810
Cassie, what the hell?
凯西，你搞什么鬼？

678
00:31:16.990 --> 00:31:18.270
It does make me feel better.
这确实让我好受多了。

679
00:31:18.270 --> 00:31:22.130
I tried to watch the pilot twice, and it just was so unsettling.
我试着看了两次试播集，但感觉太不安了。

680
00:31:22.550 --> 00:31:23.550
And too many names.
而且名字太多了。

681
00:31:23.570 --> 00:31:24.130
It didn't hook me.
没能吸引我。

682
00:31:24.670 --> 00:31:24.830
Yeah.
是啊。

683
00:31:25.770 --> 00:31:27.710
It's a lot of names, and I love that.
名字确实很多，但我很喜欢。

684
00:31:28.790 --> 00:31:29.690
I love it.
我超爱。

685
00:31:29.830 --> 00:31:31.350
Cassie, first of her name.
凯西，其名之首。

686
00:31:32.050 --> 00:31:32.450
Okay.
好吧。

687
00:31:32.650 --> 00:31:33.690
Lover of cats.
猫咪之爱人。

688
00:31:34.350 --> 00:31:35.990
Grower of plants.
植物之培育者。

689
00:31:36.430 --> 00:31:37.910
Shower of plants.
植物之展示者。

690
00:31:38.190 --> 00:31:39.470
Shower of plants.
植物之展示者。

691
00:31:39.670 --> 00:31:40.170
Thank you.
谢谢。

692
00:31:42.670 --> 00:31:44.670
Cassie's plants show well.
凯西的植物展示得很好。

693
00:31:46.250 --> 00:31:46.990
Nicely done.
干得漂亮。

694
00:31:47.650 --> 00:31:47.870
Yeah.
是啊。

695
00:31:47.950 --> 00:31:49.190
She shows up in season two.
她在第二季出场。

696
00:31:49.350 --> 00:31:49.910
So you did.
所以你确实看了。

697
00:31:50.090 --> 00:31:51.930
You made it to two seasons out of.
你看了两季。

698
00:31:52.070 --> 00:31:52.630
All right.
好吧。

699
00:31:53.090 --> 00:31:56.740
Well, anyway.
总之。

700
00:31:57.260 --> 00:31:57.420
Yeah.
是啊。

701
00:32:00.040 --> 00:32:03.640
House of Dragons is about dragons.
《龙之家族》讲的就是龙。

702
00:32:03.960 --> 00:32:05.440
They're a big part of it.
它们在剧中占了很大比重。

703
00:32:05.780 --> 00:32:06.380
Obviously.
显而易见。

704
00:32:06.380 --> 00:32:07.380
They're in the title.
毕竟标题里就有龙。

705
00:32:07.720 --> 00:32:13.900
What I'm saying is I did not know that riding on the dragons was a thing.
我想说的是，我之前根本不知道骑龙也是剧情的一部分。

706
00:32:14.320 --> 00:32:15.820
House of Dragons, you know what?
《龙之家族》，你知道吗？

707
00:32:15.980 --> 00:32:20.820
They just kind of meander on the field by the castle.
它们就那样在城堡旁的场地上漫步。

708
00:32:21.360 --> 00:32:22.660
They reference the dragon.
它们提到了龙。

709
00:32:23.220 --> 00:32:25.260
Obviously, the dragons are going to fly.
显然，龙肯定是要飞的。

710
00:32:25.260 --> 00:32:26.540
I didn't know they had people on them.
但我不知道上面还会坐人。

711
00:32:26.720 --> 00:32:26.980
Okay.
好吧。

712
00:32:27.280 --> 00:32:27.520
Okay.
好吧。

713
00:32:27.700 --> 00:32:28.140
That's fair.
这倒也合理。

714
00:32:28.280 --> 00:32:28.740
That's fair.
这倒也合理。

715
00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:29.500
It's fair.
挺合理的。

716
00:32:29.740 --> 00:32:30.220
No.
不。

717
00:32:30.720 --> 00:32:31.840
No, Sam's not having it.
不，山姆不买账。

718
00:32:32.660 --> 00:32:33.180
Okay.
好吧。

719
00:32:33.480 --> 00:32:36.200
There's another story I was not expecting to tell today.
这又是一个我今天没料到会讲的故事。

720
00:32:36.820 --> 00:32:38.120
Well, listen, everybody.
好了，各位听着。

721
00:32:38.120 --> 00:32:39.420
We love you so much.
我们非常爱你们。

722
00:32:39.500 --> 00:32:42.620
We will see you next week for AARM Part 1.
我们下周见，届时将播出《AARM》第一部分。

723
00:32:42.780 --> 00:32:43.160
Bye.
再见。

